        "refSentences": [
          "P5-S1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "B",
        "text": "The influence of consumer culture.",
        "isCorrect": true,
        "distractorType": null,
        "analysis": "【正确项 · 原文同义复现】P1-S1 明确阐述普遍公认的成因：'Grade inflation... is often considered a product of a consumer era in higher education, in which students are treated like customers to be pleased'（成绩通胀通常被视作高等教育消费时代的产物，学生被当成需要讨好的顾客）。D选项 The influence of consumer culture（消费文化的影响）与 product of a consumer era 完全同义对应。",
